# LeetCode Solutions in C

This repository contains my solutions to LeetCode coding problems, implemented using the C programming language.

The purpose of this repository is to strengthen my programming fundamentals, logical thinking, data structures, algorithms, and problem-solving skills through consistent practice.

Each file represents a solution to an individual coding problem, organized by its LeetCode problem number and title.

- **Language:** C
- **Platform:** LeetCode
- **Goal:** Learning, practice, and improving algorithmic problem-solving skills.

This repository is continuously updated as I solve more problems.
